whether it be warrior, cleric, mage all come to rest after combat and
adventuring.  The room is pitch black with walls made of obsidian and carvings
depicting the three who turned their back on the Mandala in shame and fought
for a new life for those who felt as they did.  The only light in the room
comes from three candles that the mage Arguile made to burn for eternity in
honor of the three vows that all members make to the clan and also in honor of
the three fathers, Jamar, Kalar, Gangrel.
