The Chamber of War~
This large circular underground chamber of white marble serves as the
outfitting area for the Forsaken.  Spoils of war, peace offerings from lesser
clans, and various other items that Forsaken members have gathered throughout
their travels of the world are neatly filed on the hardwood shelves here.  The
walls and ceiling are painted to show all of the Forsaken's greatest battles
and the many Forsaken heroes, both past and present.  It is truly a magnificent
sight, save for the small "Saliu wuz here" that has been deviously scribbled in
the middle of Gangrel's face...    
