#19307
&07A Pseudo-ascended Plane of Existence&00~
   Here, far above the mortal realm below, the dead can give aid to the living.
Neither part of the heavens nor part of the earthly world, everything here is
in a vague state of multi-dimensional bliss.  Simply being in this place is
sufficient to put your soul at ease, as though a residual effect is seeping
down to you from the higher planes.  Swirls of amorphous color bedazzle the eye
in a brilliant whirlpool of energy.  Direction and form are meaningless, and
the prismatic shimmering of the air is nearly hypnotic.  Spending eternity here
would be far better then some alternatives.    
~
