#19318
Front Foyer of the Castle~
   You stand in a lavishly decorated foyer; the vastness of this place is
almost as astounding as the number of exquisite collections that hang from the
walls.  A large, magically suspended chandelier floats precariously over your
head, its soft light caressing the glittering ornaments that fill the room.  
At your feet is a candlelit stairwell leading to the master bedrooms.  Silken
curtains trimmed with mithril stitching hide doorways to other areas of this
beautiful castle.  In the center of the room a massive book bobs up and down in
mid air.  As you approach the large volume, soft whispers fill your mind; they
call for you to gaze deeper into the pages and to divulge your inner most
thoughts...    
