#19319
Entrance to the Master Bedrooms~
   Walking up a set of elegantly designed stairs suspended in midair, you come
to the apex of the castle.  Warm oak lines the floors and curtains disguise
doorways to the various bed chambers.  In the center of the room is a circular
desk a mess with scrolls and parchment.  Behind the desk sits an old woman, her
face is expressionless but her eyes are filled with sadness.  As you approach
the desk the woman appears beside you, gently lifting your belongings from your
person.  You stop for a moment to wonder how such a small creature could manage
such weight, but exhaustion has set in and your thoughts are of soft pillows
and beautiful chamber maids...    
~
