#19340
The Path of Betrayal~
   You stand before the walkway leading towards the great house of the coven,
More commonly known to outsiders and un-initiates as the path of Betrayal or
Traitors walkway..  It was named so because rumor has it that those who tread
this path to join the ranks of the coven are required to forsake all ties and
break off all their oaths of loyalty.  Loyalty to the house of the coven is all
that matters.  Although there is no proof of these 'rumored' breaking of the
oaths, it has been observed that some members of the coven has eliminated
former friends or acquaintances when those persons stood in the way of the
coven.  While some members of the coven has maintained some ties, they could
never be fully trusted not to put a dagger in your back once you became
inconvenient.  You think to yourself perhaps all those rumors about the
betrayers walk are wrong?  Then again, it might possibly be true.  Taking a
long look at the clan guard.  Yet it might possible be true.    
~
