cunning thievery can be seen, while portraits of great men and fallen heroes
whom the Coven has had dealing with or have eliminated line another.  You
notice a tome on the corner of the room.  Stored within the tome is books of
knowledge accumulated by clan members of the coven.  Use the Book to learn the
latest development in the realm and to read the reports of its various agents.
You can't help but feel awe at being in a place such as this...    
