distance from the campsite.  The breeze brings a stagnant smell of something
rotten.  Upon closer inspection a shallow pit full of animal corpses can be
seen.  The corpses range from a small deer to a ferocious mountain lion.  
Something must have a dangerous hunger to lay waste to an amount this size.  A
large cauldron rests just to the left of the tent, filled with a dark red
liquid.  The tent itself has been covered in bushes and leaves to create a
camouflage effect.  Inside the tent a tiny lantern flickers in the corner.  2
blood red eyes look up but shrug you off with a hardened stare.  Whoever resides
in this tent must be a special breed of killer.
