&07Upon the Great Pedestal&00~
   You stand high above the Town Square of Freehold at the base of a massive
colossus.  Its long shadow eclipses the sun, casting darkness over you and half
the city.  You notice an entrance into the statue through the foot.  Just as
you decide to go and investigate, you notice a set of glowing crimson eyes
piercing the darkness from above.  After waiting a moment to let your eyes
adjust to the darkness, you see that they belong to a huge figure sitting at a
bench.  You hesitate, and consider going back to town.    
~
